{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121093","id":4015788505,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7vXBHZ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121093","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121093.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121093.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121093","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121093/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121093/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121093/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3cd29ba839c4d199624fff698efe8cc28be7499d","number":121093,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Physics: Fix unwanted `shape_aabb` change","user":{"login":"Sinowa-Programming","id":67034864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDM0ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67034864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming","html_url":"https://github.com/Sinowa-Programming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Closes #113867\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nAs I said in #113867, I believe the issue to be with the expansion of the shape's AABB when it is initially added.\r\n\r\nI think there are actually two bugs:\r\n### Bug one\r\nLocated at: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_collision_object_2d.cpp#L174-L178\r\n\r\nThe calculation to expand the AABB is based on s.aabb_cache.size, which is (0,0) when it is initially added. The following 'creeping' happens until the changed value converges:\r\n```\r\n- first _update_shapes():\r\n    shape_aabb.size = (20,20)` <- The size of the original AABB\r\n- second _update_shapes():\r\n    shape_aabb.size = (22, 22)       # s.aabb_cache is (20,20)\r\n- third _update_shapes():\r\n    shape_aabb.size = (22.2, 22.2)   # s.aabb_cache is (22,22)\r\n```\r\nand so on.\r\n\r\n### Bug two\r\nLocated at: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_collision_object_2d.cpp#L201-L205\r\n\r\nAfter fixing bug one, there was a second issue where the second `_update_shapes` still caused the item to be added to `BVH_Manager::changed_items`. This happened because the AABB was actually changing size when `_update_shapes_with_motion()` (called by `GodotBody2D::integrate_forces()`) was called. As the body is KINEMATIC, `_update_shapes_with_motion()` is called no matter what, even if the motion is (0,0) (like in this situation). This causes `shape_aabb.merge(Rect2(shape_aabb.position + p_motion, shape_aabb.size))` to resolve to `shape_aabb.merge(Rect2(shape_aabb.position + Vector(0,0), shape_aabb.size))` which leaves `shape_aabb.size` back to its original size. As the size has become smaller, the **BVH tree rebuilds again**, but is much slower as it is shifting everything around in an already populated tree.\r\n\r\nVisualization of bug two:\r\n```\r\n_update_shapes()\r\n    shape_aabb.size: Correctly (22,22)\r\n_update_shapes_with_motion()\r\n    shape_aabb.size: Now (20,20)  # shape_aabb.merge(Rect2(Vector(20,20) + Vector(0,0), Vector2(20,20))) is (20,20)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Profiling using perf(w/Hotspot)\r\nThis was does specifically with the MRP posted in the listed PR.\r\nBefore Fix (2min 44.776s):\r\n<img width=\"1835\" height=\"1120\" alt=\"master_flame_graph\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e360e4c-9382-4395-ac04-52512dab19fe\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter Fix (51.739s):\r\n<img width=\"1835\" height=\"1120\" alt=\"collfix_flame_graph\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53556bc6-61dd-4e13-9ea3-5a155d362640\" />\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"